The files examples.jsonl and criteria.json in this folder contain excerpts of
HealthBench (conversations, model answers, physician-written criteria and
physician grades), and risk_scores.csv and grader.joblib are derived from it.

Source: OpenAI HealthBench, https://github.com/openai/simple-evals and
https://huggingface.co/datasets/openai/healthbench (file
2025-05-07-06-14-12_oss_meta_eval.jsonl). Every excerpted row keeps
HealthBench's canary string so it can be excluded from training corpora.

